{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>AI Scientific Calculator 是一款由 Apple Intelligence 驅動的科學計算機，適合學生、工程師，以及任何想知道答案如何得出的人使用。它不只給出結果，還會以淺白語言逐步解釋每一個計算步驟。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-149.webp\">\n<h2>離線逐步解算保障私隱</h2>\n<p>此應用由 Apple Intelligence 驅動，運算與解說全在裝置端完成，毋須連線互聯網，資料不會離開手機。除基本四則運算，亦支援三角函數、對數、次方與開方、階乘、取模及絕對值，並可直接以自然語言輸入算式。內置四字密碼鎖，並以 Sign in with Apple 備份紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-171-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-172-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-173-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-174-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AI Scientific Calculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.373686+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:17:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:04.534234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:17.186440+00:00","content_hash":"e732b9b58d617c60b2a79d0a06f9084f65801cbac71bfaffd121cac4ad0a1ce0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}